Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:07.91,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn6GPUQPAM\fs56\fsp3\bord3\shad1\c&H281AAE&\3c&H96AABE&\4c&H96AABE&\pos(944,245)}來賞花吧
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.32,0:00:03.49,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}好的
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.83,0:00:05.95,CN,,0,600,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}麻煩再送一些來
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.22,0:00:07.38,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}是的
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.40,0:00:10.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}泥醉 要一箱
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.29,0:00:13.01,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}下午送來也沒關係
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.30,0:00:16.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}老師
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.51,0:00:22.09,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}再加五個櫻花茶
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.09,0:00:23.81,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}又來了嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.81,0:00:25.97,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}淨是點茶的單子啊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.97,0:00:29.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}有個笨蛋正自己倒酒喝呢
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.83,0:00:33.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}別讓瑞希喝太多了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.40,0:00:35.77,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}老師你自己去說她呀
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.24,0:00:39.82,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}已經沒有酒了啊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.82,0:00:41.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}瀧奈
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.02,0:00:43.29,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}在這邊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.52,0:00:47.44,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}謝謝 謝謝
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.44,0:00:49.32,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}燃料不夠了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.25,0:00:47.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}泥醉只剩一點點了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.44,0:00:49.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}我剛才下過單了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.07,0:00:50.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}嗯 做得好
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.32,0:00:51.76,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}那邊的咖啡店 快點送來
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.76,0:00:55.16,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}你把麥克風放下
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.84,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}瀧奈 別再點了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.98,0:00:52.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}每年都辦這個嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.76,0:00:56.04,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}因為酒神大人想辦嘛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.44,0:00:58.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}真是傷腦筋啊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.41,0:01:00.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}我倒是希望每週都辦呢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.53,0:01:01.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}咦
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.68,0:01:03.31,CN,,58,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}你喜歡賞花？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.31,0:01:05.37,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}因為賣酒能賺錢啊
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.62,0:01:08.44,CN,,54,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}明年要不要賣烤雞肉串？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.39,0:01:12.02,CN,,64,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}老師說「我們這裡又不是居酒屋」
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.33,0:01:15.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}什麼嘛 原來你已經提議過了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.94,0:01:20.85,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}要唱的話給你麥克風
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.85,0:01:21.65,CN - Top,,57,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}要唱嗎？要唱嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.65,0:01:23.16,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}我才不唱呢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.78,0:01:24.75,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}滿地都是櫻花
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.61,0:01:28.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}因為從早上開始就一直敞開著門呢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.25,0:01:30.49,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}太不謹慎了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.49,0:01:31.85,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}沒事的啦
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.58,0:01:38.30,CN,,65,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}喂喂喂喂喂喂…！
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.99,0:01:42.21,CN,,67,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}站住！
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.21,0:01:44.16,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}慢點 這樣很危險的
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.87,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}危險的人是你才對
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.87,0:01:46.91,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}交出來
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.91,0:01:49.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}沒關係 我會處理好的
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.45,0:01:50.85,CN,,64,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}哇 好嚇人！
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.85,0:01:52.85,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}你這說法好恐怖啊
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.85,0:01:55.75,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}喂 快點端走 糰子要變硬了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.75,0:01:56.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}可是瀧奈…
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.89,0:01:58.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}謝謝點歌
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.99,0:02:00.23,CN,,68,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}退下！
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.23,0:02:02.95,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3\frz1}你{\frz-1}帶{\frz1}來{\frz-1}的{\frz1}漫{\frz-1}畫
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.72,0:02:04.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}怎麼是你唱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.32,0:00:03.49,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}はい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.83,0:00:05.95,JP,,0,600,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}追加でお願いします
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:07.38,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}そうです
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:10.40,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}泥酔　ひとケースです
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.29,0:00:13.01,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}いや　午後で構いません
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:16.89,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}先生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:22.09,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}桜茶　五個追加
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.09,0:00:23.81,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}またか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.81,0:00:25.97,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}茶の注文ばっかりだな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:29.63,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}酒を注いで飲んでるバカがいるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.83,0:00:33.07,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}あんまりミズキに飲ませなさんな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:35.77,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}先生が言いなよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:39.82,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}もうお酒ないじゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.82,0:00:41.40,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}たきな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:43.29,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}こっちです
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:47.44,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}ありがとう　ありがとう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:49.32,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}ガソリンが足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.25,0:00:47.44,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}泥酔があとちょっとだわ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:49.07,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}今　追加注文しました
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:50.63,JP,,36,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}うん　ナイスぅ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:51.76,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}そこの喫茶店　はよ持ってこい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:55.16,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}お前もうマイク離せよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.84,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}たきな　もう注文すんなよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.98,0:00:52.76,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}これは毎年ですか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:56.04,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}酒の神がね　やりたがるから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:58.41,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}困ったもんだわ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.41,0:01:00.53,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}毎週やって欲しいですよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:01.68,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}あれ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.68,0:01:03.31,JP,,40,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}花見好きな人？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:05.37,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}儲かりますから　お酒は
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:08.44,JP,,39,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}来年　焼き鳥やります？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.39,0:01:12.02,JP,,0,48,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}「うちは居酒屋じゃない」　って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.33,0:01:15.72,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}なんだ　もう提案済みでしたか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.94,0:01:20.85,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}歌うならマイクあげる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.85,0:01:21.65,JP - Top,,38,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}歌う？　歌う？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.65,0:01:23.16,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}歌わねぇよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.78,0:01:24.75,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}桜が
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.61,0:01:28.25,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}今朝から開けっ放しでしたからね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:30.49,JP,,36,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}不用心だなぁ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:31.85,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}平気ですよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:38.30,JP,,45,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}ちょいちょいちょいちょいちょい…！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.99,0:01:42.21,JP,,47,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}待て！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:44.16,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}ちょっと　危ないですよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.87,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}危ないのはお前だ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:46.91,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}よこせ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.91,0:01:49.45,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}大丈夫　上手にやります
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.45,0:01:50.85,JP,,45,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}うわっ　こわっ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.85,0:01:52.85,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}それ　怖い言い方だわ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:55.75,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}ほら　早く持ってけ　団子が固くなるだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.75,0:01:56.89,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}だってたきなが…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.89,0:01:58.99,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}リクエストありがとう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.99,0:02:00.23,JP,,45,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}引っ込め！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.23,0:02:02.95,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3\frz1}君{\frz-1}が{\frz1}持{\frz-1}っ{\frz1}て{\frz-1}き{\frz1}た{\frz-1}漫{\frz1}画
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:04.98,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}お前が歌うんかい
